BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 643 Tm (Chapter 1: The Judge Above the Constitution) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 609 Tm (In every ambitious republic there comes a day when someone notices that one office) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 594 Tm (has silently risen above all the others.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 560 Tm (In Concentric, that office was the Supreme Inspectorate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 526 Tm (Its function was simple in statement and terrifying in consequence:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 492 Tm (look at the final result and decide whether the republic's claim of success should) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 477 Tm (be believed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 443 Tm (This office had to exist. Without it, the city would drown in self-report and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 428 Tm (performance theater. A mission would count because it moved, not because it truly) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 413 Tm (satisfied the task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 379 Tm (But because this office had to exist, it also had to be questioned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 345 Tm (A judge that is never calibrated becomes a risk whether it is strict or lax. If it) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 330 Tm (over-rejects, the state learns fear and hesitation. If it under-rejects, the state) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 315 Tm (learns delusion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 281 Tm (Christian saw this clearly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 247 Tm (The republic had built a judge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 213 Tm (Now it needed a way to judge the judge.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 161 Tm (Chapter 2: The Blind Court) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 127 Tm (The court for the judge was not built in the noisy district of active missions. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 112 Tm (rose in the quieter quarter where archives are reopened, protocols are debated, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 97 Tm (the republic asks what counts as evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 63 Tm (The court's foundational principle was severe and beautiful:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 21 of 27) Tj ET
endstream
