stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 723 Tm (become the jury himself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 689 Tm (The empty box is the architecture of restraint.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 637 Tm (Chapter 5: The Two Jurors) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 603 Tm (The constitution of this court requires two independent human raters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 569 Tm (That requirement transforms the meaning of the trial.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 535 Tm (One juror would tell the republic what one mind thought of one case.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 501 Tm (Two jurors let the republic ask a more demanding question:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 467 Tm (Is the evidence sufficiently legible that independent human judgment begins to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 452 Tm (converge?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 418 Tm (If they agree, the city gains more than a verdict. It gains evidence of shared) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 403 Tm (interpretability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 369 Tm (If they disagree, the city learns something equally important. It learns where) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 354 Tm (ambiguity lives, where evidence is thin, or where the task itself may not yet be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 339 Tm (stable enough for straightforward civic judgment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 305 Tm (Thus the absent jurors are already characters in the drama. The whole court is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 290 Tm (designed around their future arrival.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 238 Tm (Chapter 6: The Adjudicator's Chamber) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 204 Tm (No mature republic confuses disagreement with collapse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 170 Tm (It provides a chamber above disagreement, not to erase it, but to resolve it when) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 155 Tm (the state needs a settled public truth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 121 Tm (That chamber is adjudication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 87 Tm (If the two jurors agree, the republic has a direct consensus path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 24 of 27) Tj ET
