BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 723 Tm (If they diverge, the adjudicator enters. This officer does not invalidate the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 708 Tm (jurors. Instead the adjudicator performs a constitutional function:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 674 Tm (the conversion of unresolved divergence into an official ground truth against which) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 659 Tm (the inspector may be measured.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 625 Tm (This is one of the quiet strengths of the court. It was designed for a world in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 610 Tm (which human judgment may itself be plural.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 558 Tm (Chapter 7: The Trial Already Changes the Republic) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 524 Tm (Even before a single juror has written a verdict, the existence of the trial has) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 509 Tm (already changed Concentric.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 475 Tm (The inspectorate no longer lives beyond review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 441 Tm (The archives no longer merely preserve outcomes; they preserve future cases for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 426 Tm (legitimacy studies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 392 Tm (The executive no longer governs under the illusion that internal judgment alone is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 377 Tm (enough.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 343 Tm (And Christian no longer stands merely as a builder of capability. He stands as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 328 Tm (builder of limits.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 294 Tm (This matters because republics are not defined only by what they can do.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 260 Tm (They are defined by what they permit to question them.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 208 Tm (Chapter 8: The Three Futures) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 174 Tm (On the eve of the trial, three futures stand in the hall of possibility.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 140 Tm (In the first future, the jurors agree with each other often and the machine judge) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 125 Tm (aligns well with that consensus. The republic gains warranted trust in its) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 110 Tm (inspectorate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 76 Tm (In the second future, the jurors agree with each other but not with the judge. Then) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 61 Tm (the city learns that its highest office must be recalibrated, whether for harshness) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 28 Tm (Page 25 of 27) Tj ET
endstream
