BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 486 Tm (adjudication packets are ready. The index is written. The templates are blank. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 471 Tm (metrics wait in silence for human words.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 437 Tm (Nothing outwardly spectacular happens in the city that night.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 403 Tm (And yet it is among the most important nights in the republic's history.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 369 Tm (Because this is the night on which a founder proves that capability is not the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 354 Tm (thing as legitimacy.) Tj ET
